From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 15:16:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: keep the player open across a playlist join

At the natural end of an item the player thread exited, and the next
playlist item started a new player. The video layer was off from the
last picture of one item to the first picture of the next. An open on
a running player already changes the item without a player exit.
---
