 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.cpp        | 163 ++++++++++++++++--
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.h          |   9 +
 3 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

